<DIV class="detail">

<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" Content-type="text/css" href="/system/resource/style/component/news/content/format2.css"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
    <div class="detail_head">
            <div class="detail_head1">2026级本科生军训服装费缴费说明</div>
        </div>
        <div class="clear"></div>
        <div class="content-bt-xia">
            <span>(</span><span>发布时间： 2026年07月17日</span><span>被阅览数： <script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370298689, 2514)</script> 次</span><span>来源：</span><span>)</span>
        </div>         <div class="detail_main"><div id="vsb_content_2"><div class="v_news_content">
<p class="vsbcontent_start" style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">一、缴费开放时间</span></strong></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">2026年8月13日8:00起正式开放缴费通道。</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">二、军训服装全套内容及费用</span></strong></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">全套军训服总价132元，包括以下内容：</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">1.迷彩服1套（含帽子、上衣、裤子）</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">2.体能服圆领短袖T恤2件</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">3.迷彩胶鞋1双</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">4.内腰带、外腰带各1条</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">5.马扎1个</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">6.白手套1双</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">7.包装袋1个</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">注：白手套将在军训中途统一发放</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">三、缴费方式</span></strong></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">方式1：扫码缴费</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">扫描学校专用二维码，直接跳转校园统一支付平台办理缴费。</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">方式2：迎新系统缴费</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">登录学校迎新系统，进入【财务缴费】模块完成缴费。</span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">方式3：直接扫码【军训服装费代收-2026级学生军训服缴费（2026070007）】进行缴费。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img src="/__local/5/21/7E/B55C4FAB9C7AB6F9227E08DCD13_4DF46D07_4326.png" width="250" height="308" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/5217EB55C4FAB9C7AB6F9227E08DCD13/4DF46D07/4326" vheight=" 308px" vwidth=" 250px" orisrc="/__local/5/21/7E/B55C4FAB9C7AB6F9227E08DCD13_4DF46D07_4326.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 250px; height: 308px;"></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;"><strong>四、截屏支付记录</strong></span></p><p style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">支付完成后，在西安电子科技大学校园统一支付平台【菜单】中选择【已缴费查询】，截屏军训服缴费记录留存手机，领取军训服时出示缴费凭证。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img src="/__local/A/EC/DC/4913DCD30852D52BEC693A4848E_5248D8B3_E13D.jpeg" width="227" height="400" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/AECDC4913DCD30852D52BEC693A4848E/5248D8B3/E13D" vheight=" 400px" vwidth=" 227px" orisrc="/__local/0/53/10/61A4E566187944CB942DD5A8CD8_5605D0AF_1C9A8.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 227px;height: 400px"><img src="/__local/4/96/3B/1C3010A86BCCE1C22FD73547A5A_A35F8C12_9DB4.jpeg" width="232" height="400" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/4963B1C3010A86BCCE1C22FD73547A5A/A35F8C12/9DB4" vheight=" 400px" vwidth=" 232px" orisrc="/__local/A/35/75/3C0C8B636CC09417FA9E3D0E5EE_D07C488C_122AC.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 232px;height: 400px"></p><p style="text-align: right;"><br></p><p style="text-align: right;">西安电子科技大学人民武装部</p><p class="vsbcontent_end" style="text-align: right;">2026年7月13日&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
